tion></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 7 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DFhmz2Ehn/\" target=\"_blank\">Doomer</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7f65f1813d0d3a0bbd874ff974c1a8d5ed7f8b89.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 6 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV148tzzVEoK/\" target=\"_blank\">小小的我</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3b997ab76b99a71344a6f596b7feabd11b1246c8.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 5 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SfK9zPEL3/\" target=\"_blank\">不要听那姓T的话</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e3e43ede3d0d379f294a3bfc4a8730e07047da8b.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 4 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YLxszzETc/\" target=\"_blank\">明明昨天就应该死去</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9b9e7e5290ce52683f6029fa3a49a83b73868184.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 3 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JThqzwEGq/\" target=\"_blank\">誓见“好朋友”</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/90aa2fb1a20f53fb8d5616e6e2d51898d54f1167.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !importa